@startuml TripOS_Money_Path
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ParticipantPadding 8

title TripOS — Quote → Pay → Book (Money Path)

actor Agent
participant "Web" as Web
participant "API" as API
participant "Redis\n(cache)" as Redis
participant "Adapter\n(mock|TBO)" as Adapter
database "Postgres" as DB
participant "Worker" as Worker
actor Customer
participant "Razorpay\n/ mock" as Pay

== Search (browse may be indicative) ==
Agent -> Web : Search flights
Web -> API : POST /inventory/search/flights
API -> Redis : cache hit?
alt cache miss / live path
  API -> Adapter : search()
  Adapter --> API : NormalizedOffer[]
  API -> Redis : store shopping cache
end
API --> Web : offers + inventory_mode

== Quote ==
Agent -> Web : Create quote + markup + pax
Web -> API : POST /quotes\nPUT passengers\nPOST ready / send
API -> DB : OfferSnapshot + quote
API --> Web : public_token / wa.me link

== Pay (always revalidate) ==
Customer -> Web : Open /q/{token}
Web -> API : GET /public/quotes/{token}
Agent -> Web : Create pay link\n(or customer pays)
Web -> API : POST /quotes/{id}/payment
API -> Adapter : revalidate() **live**
API -> Pay : create order / link
Pay --> Customer : pay
Pay -> API : webhook\n(or mark-paid-offline)
API -> DB : quote paid + outbox job

== Confirm (async) ==
Worker -> DB : claim outbox
Worker -> Adapter : revalidate() + book()
Adapter --> Worker : PNR / booking ref
Worker -> DB : Booking confirmed
Agent -> Web : See booking / attention desk

@enduml
